🎗️ 28.4 Shared Resource

🔴 The main shared resource is: currNumber
🔴 All three threads access the same RemainderManager object.

Conceptually:

  RemainderManager
       |
    currNumber limit
     /    |    \
    /     |     \
  T0     T1     T2

There is:

🔴 One shared counter
🔴 One limit
🔴 One common monitor
🔴 Three worker threads

This is similar to Producer–Consumer, where Producer and Consumer use the same SharedBuffer object and therefore the same shared state/monitor.

