👉 Complete Flow

1 % 3 = 1 → Thread-1
2 % 3 = 2 → Thread-2
3 % 3 = 0 → Thread-0

4 % 3 = 1 → Thread-1
5 % 3 = 2 → Thread-2
6 % 3 = 0 → Thread-0

7 % 3 = 1 → Thread-1
8 % 3 = 2 → Thread-2
