🎗️ 28.31 Core Synchronization Pattern

This is the most important part to remember:

Acquire Monitor
      ↓
Check Condition
      ↓
Condition False
      ↓
wait()
      ↓
Wake Up
      ↓
Re-check Condition
      ↓
Condition True
      ↓
Do Work
      ↓
Update Shared State
      ↓
notifyAll()
      ↓
Repeat

This is the same fundamental pattern as the Producer–Consumer problem.
